The netscaler_* compatibility types reuse its type and attribute names, its
attribute mappings onto NITRO, its value spellings and its autorequires
(lib/puppet_x/netscaler/compat_definitions.rb and the generated
lib/puppet/type/netscaler_*.rb).

The nitro_* types and their runtime metadata (lib/puppet/type/nitro_*.rb,
lib/puppet/provider/nitro_*/ and lib/puppet_x/netscaler/specs.rb) are
generated by tools/generate.rb from the NetScaler NITRO API definitions of
NetScaler 14.1 build 73.58: the OpenAPI specification (nitro-oas.tgz,
"Nitro API Specification") and the REST API reference (nitro-rest.tgz,
"Citrix NetScaler - NITRO API Documentation"), downloaded directly from a
NetScaler VPX appliance. Those archives are not part of this module.
